Recently, someone pointed out that shopkeepers won't come kill you if they
can't see you when you attack with a wand or missile. The same is true if
*you* can't see *them*. If you blind yourself, and you don't have telepathy,
and you blast a shopkeeper with a wand from a space or two away (so that you're
not touching, but you can be sure of where he is standing) then you can kill
the shopkeeper with impunity.


